WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:04.020
Best known for playing Tommy Oliver&nbsp;
in the "Power Rangers" franchise,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:09.720
actor and mixed martial artist Jason David&nbsp;
Frank died at the age of 49 on November 19.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:13.200
As of the making of this video, the cause&nbsp;
of his death has not been made public.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:17.880
Even though "Mighty Morphin Power Rangers"&nbsp;
only aired for three seasons back in the '90s,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:21.300
Frank stayed connected to the "Power&nbsp;
Rangers" franchise. While some might&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:25.500
write the series off as a silly show for&nbsp;
kids, many episodes explored important&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:29.820
themes like friendship and responsibility. The&nbsp;
simplistic character designs were an easy way&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:33.420
to capture a child's imagination while&nbsp;
delivering some valuable life lessons.

00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:39.900
Frank played Tommy Oliver, AKA the Green&nbsp;
Ranger, as recently as 2018, and he continued to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:43.980
demonstrate his pride in the franchise on social&nbsp;
media. The character was initially introduced&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.980 --> 00:00:49.080
as a short-term antagonist, but Frank's dynamic&nbsp;
performance and extensive martial arts training&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:53.400
helped him carve out a permanent place for the&nbsp;
character. If you're a fan of Frank's work, then&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:58.260
you'll be glad to know that his final project pays&nbsp;
homage to the years he spent as the Green Ranger.

00:00:58.260 --> 00:01:02.940
From the looks of it, "Legend of the White&nbsp;
Dragon" is a blend of fantasy, science fiction,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:02.940 --> 00:01:08.040
and dystopian action-thriller. The crowdfunded&nbsp;
film began as a Kickstarter campaign in March&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:08.040 --> 00:01:14.040
2020, reaching its $500,000 goal only a&nbsp;
few months later. In July 2021, Frank told&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:18.840
ComicBook.com that a private investor took over&nbsp;
from there, but the film's future is unclear.

00:01:18.840 --> 00:01:22.440
According to the campaign website, the&nbsp;
film is currently in post-production,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:22.440 --> 00:01:26.880
with no hard release date set. Joining&nbsp;
Frank in the cast is Jason Faunt from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:26.880 --> 00:01:30.780
"Power Rangers Time Force" and Ciara&nbsp;
Hanna "Power Rangers Megaforce."

00:01:30.780 --> 00:01:34.860
According to the movie's website, the plot&nbsp;
follows a humbled warrior returning home&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:39.840
after being defeated in battle. Frank plays Erik&nbsp;
Reed, known as the "White Dragon" before his power&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:39.840 --> 00:01:44.580
source was destroyed during combat. Without access&nbsp;
to the full breadth of his powers and shunned by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:44.580 --> 00:01:49.080
the people he wasn't strong enough to protect,&nbsp;
Reed is determined to defeat the evil wreaking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:49.080 --> 00:01:53.820
havoc on his home. However, he'll need more than&nbsp;
luck to regain his powers and avenge his name.

00:01:53.820 --> 00:01:58.320
While the premise of the PG-13 film has a&nbsp;
somewhat darker tone than Frank's past work,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:58.320 --> 00:02:02.520
Erik Reed's backstory is reminiscent&nbsp;
of Tommy Oliver's storyline in "Mighty&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:02.520 --> 00:02:06.660
Morphin Power Rangers." Viewers will recall&nbsp;
that the Green Ranger found redemption as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:06.660 --> 00:02:10.106
the White Ranger after being freed&nbsp;
from Rita Repulsa's mind control.

00:02:10.620 --> 00:02:11.743
"Is it really you?"

00:02:12.340 --> 00:02:13.380
"In the flesh."

00:02:14.214 --> 00:02:18.540
Despite the otherworldly setting, the lesson&nbsp;
at the heart of the story is based in reality.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:18.540 --> 00:02:23.340
Similar to how "Mighty Morphin Power Rangers"&nbsp;
used fantastical storylines to help make the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:23.340 --> 00:02:28.560
heartwarming morals pack a punch, the minds behind&nbsp;
"Legend of the White Dragon" used the same tactic&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:28.560 --> 00:02:33.120
when crafting the plot of the film. According&nbsp;
to Frank, feelings like isolation and regret&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:33.120 --> 00:02:37.680
inspired his character's emotional journey. Even&nbsp;
though Reed is a character with incredible powers,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:37.680 --> 00:02:42.844
he has his problems just like everyone&nbsp;
else. Frank told ComicBook.com back in 2021,

00:02:57.000 --> 00:03:00.720
Frank was promoting "Legend of the White&nbsp;
Dragon" in the months leading up to his death,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:00.720 --> 00:03:06.240
including showing off the character's helmet and a&nbsp;
fan tattoo on his Instagram. It's unclear when the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:11.820
film will come out, though Vulture reports it is&nbsp;
currently "expected to release sometime in 2023."

